## 2024-09-18 Gabriele Cosmo (test28-V11-02-00)
- Migrated to use G4RunManagerFactory with default Tasking run-manager.
- Use default random number generator.

## 2021-12-10 Ben Morgan (test28-V11-00-00)
- Change to new Markdown History format

