# History entries prior to 11.0

4 August 2021 Ben Morgan (test28-V10-07-05)
---------------------------------------------------
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project

5 May 2021 Ben Morgan (test28-V10-07-04)
----------------------------------------
- Do not install tests

18 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test28-V10-07-03)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList :  replaced G4HadronCaptureProcess with
  G4NeutronCaptureProcess.

08 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test28-V10-07-02)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList : removed header files of old and unused ion
  cross sections (that have been deleted).

04 March 2021 Alberto Ribon (test28-V10-07-01)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList : replaced particle-specific inelastic hadronic
  processes (that have been deleted) with G4HadronInelasticProcess.

18 February 2021 Ben Morgan (test28-V10-07-00)
----------------------------------------------
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

16 August 2019  V. Ivanchenko  (test28-V10-05-01)
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList: use Glauber-Gribov x-sections for ion nuclear
    interaction, disable multi-fragmentation de-excitation,
    fixed EM physics; chash in nightly should be fixed

08 March 2019  V. Ivanchenko  (test28-V10-05-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList: use Glauber-Gribov x-sections

09 August 2018  A. Ribon      (test28-V10-04-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList : replaced the explicit high-energy limit of hadronic
  physics with the one from G4HadronicParameters .

07 March 2017  V. Ivanchenko  (test28-V10-03-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList: removed obsolete instantiation of de-excitation
    module, use a standard one

13-October-2016 G.Folger  (test28-V10-02-00)
----------------------------------------------------
 remove direct use of theParticleIterator, use GetParticleTableIterator().
    fix required by clang39 on Windows and MAC

13 November 2013  V. Ivanchenko  (test28-V10-00-00) - not tagged
---------------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList: rename EM dissociation process to distingwish it from
    ion inelastic process

22 July 2013  Dennis Wright  (test28-V09-06-02)
-----------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList: remove fission process (redundant) and replace G4LCapture
  with G4NeutronRadCapture

2 July 2013  Dennis Wright  (test28-V09-06-01)
----------------------------------------------
- Tst28PhysicsList: replace LEP models with Bertini and FTFP

12 June 2013  Dennis Wright (test28-V09-06-00)
----------------------------------------------
- Migrate to multi-threaded:
    added option to use G4MTRunManager in test28.cc
    created class Tst28ActionInitialization and moved some user init methods
      there
    added empty method Tst28GeometryConstruction::ConstructSDandField()

- added CMakeLists_Standalone.txt to be used for stand-alone running
  (developed by Makoto Asai)

- updated README for cmake build

09-Oct-2012, Gabriele Cosmo (test28-V09-05-01)
----------------------------------------------
- Explicit inclusion of units and constants headers.

27-Jul-2012, Vladimir Ivanchenko (test28-V09-05-00)
---------------------------------------------------
- Fixed hadron elastic.

15-Jun-2011, Gunter Folger (test28-V09-04-00)
---------------------------------------------
- Update test28.in to replace obsolete /run/particle/SetCut by /run/SetCut.

